---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const entry = {
  "id": "harvard_ii1_55",
  "series": "Band II 1 (1663 - 1685)",
  "seq": 55,
  "text": "<p> [[150.1]] <b>48. HEINRICH OLDENBURG AN LEIBNIZ</p>\n<p> [[150.2]] London, 14. (24.) April 1671. [46.56.]</b></p>\n<p> [[150.15]] Ampliss^#'o et Consultiss^#'o Viro </p>\n<p> [[150.16]] Dⁿ^#'o Gothofredo Guilielmo Leibnitzio J.U.D. et </p>\n<p> [[150.17]] Consilio Moguntino Digniss^#'o </p>\n<p> [[150.18]] H. Oldenburg Sal. </p>\n<p> [[150.19]] Recte accepi, Vir Nobiliss^#'e, <i>Hypothesin</i> tuam <i>Physicam,</i> typis Moguntinis editam, et mox\n[[150.20]] prima ferente occasione coram Soc. Regia produxi. Praelecta ipsi fuit honorifica Dedicatio,\n[[150.21]] protinusque nonnullis ejus sociis in mandatis datum, ut libellum istum evolverent et expenderent,\n[[150.22]] suamque de eo sententiam, quam primum fieri commode posset, in caetu publico\n[[150.23]] referrent. Id dum agitur, suadere velim, Vir optime, ut partem alteram quantocyus ad me, tuta\n[[150.24]] occasione, expedire ne graveris, cum intelligam Ego, viros illos, quibus examinis hujus provincia\n[[150.25]] est demandata, vix quicquam de re tota pronunciaturos esse, nisi et tuam de <i>Abstracta\n[[150.26]] Motus theoria</i> doctrinam, saepe a Te citatam et pluribus positionibus substratam, cognoverint.\n[[150.27]] Interim, quantum colligo, non displicet opera tua iis qui inspexere, certe mihi perplacet, qui ad\n[[150.28]] multa Te respexisse percipio. Cum posteriora videro scripti hujus, mox Hypothesi tota <i>Transactiones\n[[150.29]] Philosophicas</i> exornare satagam. </p>\n<p> [[151.1]] Quamprimum de Machinae Wernerianae successu certi quid acceperis, nobis quoque\n[[151.2]] impertiri ne graveris. Rationem dulcificandi aquam Marinam invenies impressam N^#'o 67. <i>Transact.\n[[151.3]] philosophicarum</i>, <Fn><i>Dazu von Leibniz' Hand</i>: N. 67. <i>transactionum</i> nondum habeo.</Fn> quantum quidem ejus retegere Inventori visum fuit. </p>\n<p> [[151.4]] Famigeratum illud Grandamici de Terrella Magnetica Experimentum successu carere,\n[[151.5]] satis liquet ex iis, quae ex Dn. Petiti epistola in <i>Transact. phil.</i> n^#'o 28. inserta habentur. <Fn><i>Dazu von Leibniz' Hand</i>: Locutus sum de experimento Grandamici, sed in <i>Transact.</i> n. 28 refutatur tantum experimentum Gilberti de conversione spontanea terrellae.</Fn> </p>\n<p> [[151.6]] Operam dabo, ut cura Martini nostri libros a Te hinc desideratos accipias; <Fn><i>Dazu zwei Randbemerkungen von Leibniz' Hand</i>: Dan. Plate <i>de rebus subterraneis</i>, Anglice, <so> ex <Leibniz special character: an = Antimon>ⁿ^#'i^#'o sine fructu. ^&.za <Leibniz special character> ex <so> inter experimenta Societatis. <i>Daneben</i>: Inclinatio magnetica. Sprat contra Sorberium. Wilkins.</Fn> Vale et porro\n[[151.7]] Tui studiosissimo fave. Raptim Londini d. 14. April. 1671. </p>\n<p> [[151.8]] P. S. Ne, quaeso, invideas mihi peculiares illas, quas dicis, de Deo ac mente demonstrationes;\n[[151.9]] circa quas nonnulla innuis, quae me perquam attonitum habent, adeoque stimulant,\n[[151.10]] ut tanto importunius eorum communicationem expetam. </p>\n<p> [[151.11]] Literae tuae mihi destinatae per tabellionem semper, quaeso, inscribantur <i>A Monsieur\n[[151.12]] Mons^#'r Grubendol à Londres. Franc à Anvers ou Amsterdam.</i> </p>\n<p> [[151.13]] Nobilliss^#'o et Consultiss^#'o Viro Dⁿ^#'o Gothofredo Guilielmo Leibnitzio J.U.D. et Consiliario\n[[151.14]] Moguntino etc. Mogunt. </p>\n",
  "number": "48.",
  "title": "HEINRICH OLDENBURG AN LEIBNIZ",
  "date": "London, 14. (24.) April 1671. [46.56.]"
};
---

<Layout title={`${entry.title || entry.id} - Leibniz Writings`}>
  <article data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="entry-header">
      <h1 data-pagefind-meta="title">{entry.title || entry.id}</h1>

      <div class="entry-meta">
        {entry.date && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Date:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="date">{entry.date}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Series:</strong>
          <span data-pagefind-meta="series">{entry.series}</span>
        </div>

        {entry.number && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Number:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="number">{entry.number}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Sequence:</strong>
          <span>{entry.seq}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="entry-content" data-pagefind-meta="excerpt:48. HEINRICH OLDENBURG AN LEIBNIZ London, 14. (24.) April 1671. [46.56.] Ampliss^#'o et Consultiss^#'o Viro Dⁿ^#'o Gothofredo Guilielmo Leibnitzio J.U.D. et Consilio Moguntino Digniss^#'o H. Oldenburg Sal. Recte accepi, Vir Nobiliss^#'e, Hypothesin tuam Physicam, typis Moguntinis editam, et mox prim...">
      <div class="text-content">
        {entry.text.split('\n').map(paragraph =>
          paragraph.trim() && <p set:html={paragraph} />
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <nav class="entry-navigation">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Search</a>
  </nav>
</Layout>

<style>
  .entry-header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .entry-header h1 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .entry-meta {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .meta-item strong {
    color: var(--text);
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .meta-item span {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .entry-content {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .text-content {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 30px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .text-content :global(p) {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .text-content :global(p:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .text-content :global(b) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .entry-navigation {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .entry-meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>